Analog Canvas native result adapter transient reference

ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"
model resistance resistor
model capacitance capacitor
model voltage vsource
V1 (input 0) voltage type="pulse" val0=0 val1=1 delay=1u rise=100n fall=100n width=20u period=40u
R1 (input output) resistance r=1k
C1 (output 0) capacitance c=1n

control
  abort always
  options rawfile="ascii" strictsave=2
  save default
  analysis result_tran tran stop=4u step=1u maxstep=1u
endc
